sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant UI as React Dashboard
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant C as TrueData Collector
    participant TD as TrueData

    C->>TD: Connect and authenticate
    C->>TD: Subscribe NSE and BSE symbols
    TD-->>C: Heartbeat / trade / quote messages
    C->>C: Parse and normalize trade data
    C->>C: Process Bid/Ask and BSE bidaskL2
    C->>DB: Store/update live tick

    User->>UI: Open dashboard
    UI->>API: GET /api/market/live
    API->>DB: Query latest ticks
    DB-->>API: NSE + BSE market data
    API-->>UI: JSON response
    UI-->>User: Display market data

    UI->>API: GET /api/market/status
    API->>DB: Read latest tick timestamp
    DB-->>API: Timestamp
    API-->>UI: Session/feed status

    User->>UI: Select ALL / NSE / BSE
    UI->>UI: Filter returned records
    UI-->>User: Display selected exchange
